# Diagnostic: the field Item page (docs/plan-cards.md 2.2). Jian gets the Blazing Ring and the Quetzalcoatl
# card in the bag; X, Items, then each page in turn (shots ip_*), the accessory page's item picked for Jian,
# who already wears Counter Prototype in his accessory slot. Logs the menu state and Jian's slot 4.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213B9FA 1
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
watch u16 0x020B46A0 jian_slot4
watch u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5
watch u16 0x020B46A4 jian_slot6
watch u8 0x0213B9FA ring_count
watch u8 0x0213BA1B card_count
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot ip_00
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_01
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_02
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_03
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_04
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_05
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ip_06
press R 8
wait 30
shot ip_07
press R 8
wait 30
shot ip_08
press R 8
wait 30
shot ip_09
press R 8
wait 30
shot ip_10
press R 8
wait 30
shot ip_11
press A 8
wait 40
shot ip_12
press A 8
wait 40
shot ip_13
press A 8
wait 40
shot ip_14
press A 8
wait 60
shot ip_15
